  "description": "Outbox and Inbox pattern implementation for MassTransit with PostgreSQL and EF Core. Supports multiple DbContexts for modular monolith and microservice architectures. Uses PostgreSQL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED for concurrency control.",
